"Presets" = "Presets";
"Save the current EQ under a name, update it later, or delete it." = "Save the current EQ under a name, update it later, or delete it.";
"A preset can be bound to an output device and is applied automatically whenever that device becomes the output — useful when headphones and speakers need different correction." = "A preset can be bound to an output device and is applied automatically whenever that device becomes the output — useful when headphones and speakers need different correction.";
"Panel" = "Panel";
"The pin keeps the panel open when you click elsewhere; click the menu bar icon to close it." = "The pin keeps the panel open when you click elsewhere; click the menu bar icon to close it.";
